{"ref":"BDB, פֶּ֫טֶר","hw":"פֶּ֫טֶר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">פֶּ֫טֶר</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>that which separates, first opens</strong>;—cstr., <span dir=\"rtl\">פּ׳ רֶחֶם</span> i.e. firstborn, of man and beast, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 20:26\" href=\"/Ezekiel.20.26\">Ez 20:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:12\" href=\"/Exodus.13.12\">Ex 13:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:15\" href=\"/Exodus.13.15\">15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:19\" href=\"/Exodus.34.19\">34:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:15\" href=\"/Numbers.18.15\">Nu 18:15</a>; appos. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּכוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:2\" href=\"/Exodus.13.2\">Ex 13:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 3:12\" href=\"/Numbers.3.12\">Nu 3:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">רֶחֶם</span> om. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:12\" href=\"/Exodus.13.12\">Ex 13:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 13:13\" href=\"/Exodus.13.13\">13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:19\" href=\"/Exodus.34.19\">34:19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:20\" href=\"/Exodus.34.20\">20</a>.","next":"BDB, פִּטְרָה","prev":"BDB, פָּטַר"}